@startuml sell-architecture-overview
!include sell-style.puml
title <size:12><color:#087F8C>04 / PORTS AND ADAPTERS</color></size>\nDependencies point toward the core

top to bottom direction
rectangle "<b>REST adapter</b>\n<size:12>adapters-inbound-rest</size>\nCalls inbound ports" as Rest
rectangle "<b>Persistence adapters</b>\n<size:12>JPA / MySQL or MongoDB</size>\nImplements outbound ports" as Storage
rectangle "<b>Market adapters</b>\n<size:12>Finnhub / Alpha Vantage</size>\nImplements outbound ports" as Market
rectangle "<b>Application</b>\n\nInbound ports: use-case contracts\nServices: orchestration\nOutbound ports: storage and quotes" as App #E6F3F1
rectangle "<b>Domain</b>\n\nPortfolio · Holding · Lot\nMoney · Price · ShareQuantity\nFIFO rules and sale outcome" as Domain #E6F3F1
Rest -down-> App
Storage -down-> App
Market -down-> App
App -down-> Domain
note bottom of Domain
  Arrows show source-code dependencies.
  At runtime, services call outbound ports.
  bootstrap wires the selected implementations.
end note
@enduml
